  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Enhanced enabling measures for creating decent jobs and rural economy development</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The intervention improves access to basic services and creates employment opportunities for forcibly displaced persons and host communities by integrating Employment Intensive Investment Programme (EIIP) approaches into green works and water, sanitation and hygiene (WASH) infrastructure development. During the biennium, the intervention will support the introduction of Employment Intensive Investment Programme approaches in sanitation and water, sanitation and hygiene projects, as well as the expansion of green works activities, contributing to job creation, improved living conditions, and local economic recovery.</narrative>
  </description>
